---

## 1. Executive Summary & Architecture Overview

Sreenidhi Express (`in.edu.suh.express`) is a production-grade, zero-cost (₹0 budget) campus transit intelligence and student safety platform purpose-built for Sreenidhi Institute of Science and Technology (SNIST). It provides real-time bus telemetry, route coordination, gate boarding verification, automated parent safety notifications, and administrative fleet management without requiring paid third-party APIs or specialized hardware trackers.

---

## 2. Table of Contents

1. [`package.json`](#packagejson) — *Package dependencies, Node engine requirements (>=22.12.0), Capacitor plugins, and npm scripts.*
2. [`vite.config.ts`](#viteconfigts) — *Vite 8 build engine configuration with React and Tailwind CSS plugins.*
3. [`capacitor.config.ts`](#capacitorconfigts) — *Capacitor 8 Android and native mobile configuration for Sreenidhi Express (in.edu.suh.express).*
4. [`index.html`](#indexhtml) — *HTML5 light-first application shell (#F7F9FF theme, electric pre-hydration splash, responsive mobile viewport, localhost SW cleanup).*
5. [`public/sw.js`](#publicswjs) — *Self-cleaning and cache purge Service Worker with clean native network pass-through (no stream-locking fetch interception).*
6. [`src/index.css`](#srcindexcss) — *Tailwind CSS 4 setup, Prismatic Daylight Glass tokens (.bg-prismatic-canvas, .prismatic-card, .electric-hero, .electric-cta, .futuristic-tile), and pulse animations (Leaflet CSS stripped).*
7. [`server/security.js`](#serversecurityjs) — *Hardened security engine: scrypt password hashing, RFC 7519 HS256 JWT sessions, brute-force IP rate-limiting, LAN & local CORS origin matching, DELETE method support, event allowlist validation, and time-skew gate tokens.*
8. [`server/routeTopology.js`](#serverroutetopologyjs) — *Canonical transit route topology, area clusters, stop coordinates, and fuzzy student-stop matching engine for Route 51 & Route 14.*
9. [`server/dbExtras.js`](#serverdbextrasjs) — *SQLite migration layer (verification_status, trip started_at, stop_dwell_logs, otp_verifications PK), prepared statement caching, student verification queue, 60-day dwell audit logs, Route 51 manifest seeding, and audit logging.*
10. [`server/index.js`](#serverindexjs) — *Express 5 REST API server with timing-safe HMAC JWT auth, self-signup + 1-click admin verification, self-checkin boarding, stop dwell audit logging, 1-hour pre-departure absence cutoff, SSE live stream tickets, and CARTO tile proxy.*
11. [`server/excelStorage.js`](#serverexcelstoragejs) — *Real-time Excel engine with SQLite WAL persistence, prepared statement cache, configurable DATA_DIR / DB_FILE_PATH / EXCEL_FILE_PATH, and atomic XLSX export.*
12. [`server/telegramNotifier.js`](#servertelegramnotifierjs) — *Automated Telegram Bot safety alert integration for student transit events and driver dispatches.*
13. [`tests/security.test.js`](#testssecuritytestjs) — *Comprehensive unit test suite verifying tokens, password hashing, rate limiting, gate token skew, event schema allowlists, Route 51 manifest integrity, area cluster optimization, billing cycle reset, faculty role separation, PRAGMA busy_timeout, push subscriptions, 14-day median ETAs, bulk onboarding, single-use stream tickets, OSRM geometry cache, admin health RBAC, tile proxy validation, v19 OTP onboarding, v20 pilot hardening & verification, v20.3 timestamp report & CSV headers, and v20.4 / v20.4.3 multi-admin auth, GPS schematic projection, 9-waypoint mobile Google Maps route URL & forgot-password workflow (42/42 passing).*
14. [`src/types/transit.ts`](#srctypestransitts) — *Complete TypeScript type contracts for buses, students, telemetry, geofences, and safety alerts.*
15. [`src/config/apiConfig.ts`](#srcconfigapiconfigts) — *Environment variables, backend endpoints, and API client configuration.*
16. [`src/data/sreenidhiData.ts`](#srcdatasreenidhidatats) — *Hyderabad NH-163 Warangal Highway transit network stops, student master roster, Route 51 manifest (18 students + 8 faculty), and fleet definitions.*
17. [`src/main.tsx`](#srcmaintsx) — *React 19 application bootstrapping and DOM hydration with RootErrorBoundary.*
18. [`src/App.tsx`](#srcapptsx) — *Root view router, role management, responsive edge-to-edge max-w-5xl/6xl layout, and theme synchronization.*
19. [`src/context/useCommuteSimulation.ts`](#srccontextusecommutesimulationts) — *Hook exposing commute simulation context, bus state, and action dispatchers.*
20. [`src/context/CommuteSimulationContext.tsx`](#srccontextcommutesimulationcontexttsx) — *Master state machine managing real-time bus telemetry, geofencing, safety timers, and backend synchronization.*
21. [`src/components/auth/StudentLoginPage.tsx`](#srccomponentsauthstudentloginpagetsx) — *Multi-role authentication screen featuring scrypt student login, 6-digit driver PIN input, parent access code sign-in, and responsive full-width mobile container.*
22. [`src/services/firebaseSyncService.ts`](#srcservicesfirebasesyncservicets) — *Firebase Realtime Database synchronization listener for telemetry updates and active bus positioning.*
23. [`src/components/common/MobileBottomNav.tsx`](#srccomponentscommonmobilebottomnavtsx) — *Bottom navigation bar optimized for mobile viewports and Capacitor native shells.*
24. [`src/components/common/SreenidhiLogo.tsx`](#srccomponentscommonsreenidhilogotsx) — *Official branded Sreenidhi Express shield and bus insignia component.*
25. [`src/components/portals/StudentPortal.tsx`](#srccomponentsportalsstudentportaltsx) — *Prismatic Daylight 4-tab Student Commuter Portal (Home, Map, Help, More) with 2-row header, electric indigo-cyan ETA window hero, map preview card, docked bottom nav, and 1h opt-out cutoff.*
26. [`src/components/portals/DriverConsole.tsx`](#srccomponentsportalsdriverconsoletsx) — *Prismatic Daylight 3-tab Driver Cockpit (Trip, Stops, Alerts) with electric live headcount hero card, trip start IST timer, next stop & delay broadcaster, and geofence controls.*
27. [`src/components/portals/AdminDashboard.tsx`](#srccomponentsportalsadmindashboardtsx) — *Prismatic Daylight 3-tab Transport Admin Desk (Verify, Fleet, Logs) with electric pending approvals hero card, 1-click verification queue, fleet matrix, and health/CSV tools.*
28. [`src/components/portals/ParentPortal.tsx`](#srccomponentsportalsparentportaltsx) — *Prismatic Daylight Parent oversight portal (feature-gated via VITE_ENABLE_PARENT_PORTAL) for tracking child bus arrival, lost item reporting, and WhatsApp/in-app safety alerts.*
29. [`src/services/corridorProjection.ts`](#srcservicescorridorprojectionts) — *Pure equirectangular GPS-to-route segment projection engine, Haversine meter calculation, and zero-cost buildGoogleMapsRouteUrl multi-stop Directions URL helper shared across portals.*
30. [`src/components/map/MetroSchematicMap.tsx`](#srccomponentsmapmetroschematicmaptsx) — *Unified responsive ₹0 GPS-Driven Curved Metro-Style SVG Schematic Map rendered with all stops inside a horizontally scrollable track on Home compact preview and Map/Driver/Admin/Parent views, smart user-scroll-respecting auto-centering, +8px lower-label bus pin clearance, external HUD bars, and Open Full Route in Google Maps multi-stop Directions link.*
31. [`scripts/load-test.mjs`](#scriptsloadtestmjs) — *Zero-dependency concurrency and load benchmark validating SSE connections, sub-100ms latency, and 0% error rate.*
32. [`src/services/eventQueue.ts`](#srcserviceseventqueuets) — *IndexedDB resilient offline event queue with priority eviction, backoff retry, and idempotency keys.*
33. [`src/services/excelService.ts`](#srcservicesexcelservicets) — *Central API client handling authenticated JWT sessions, public getServerBaseUrl() / authHeaders(), gate check-in, and offline event synchronization.*
34. [`src/services/osrmRoutingService.ts`](#srcservicesosrmroutingservicets) — *OSRM routing engine for real-world road network path-following along NH-163 Warangal Highway.*
35. [`src/services/firebaseService.ts`](#srcservicesfirebaseservicets) — *Firebase Realtime Database synchronization for cross-device live bus telematics.*
36. [`src/services/nativeDeviceService.ts`](#srcservicesnativedeviceservicets) — *Capacitor mobile hardware bridge: accuracy-filtered GPS tracking, BLE gate beacon scanner, haptics, and notifications.*
37. [`src/services/audioSpeechService.ts`](#srcservicesaudiospeechservicets) — *Web Speech API and audio chimes for driver voice HUD alerts and wake-up notifications.*
38. [`src/services/mapsService.ts`](#srcservicesmapsservicets) — *Google Maps calculated live ETA engine providing exact HH:MM:SS arrival countdowns.*
39. [`src/components/notifications/MobileAlertCard.tsx`](#srccomponentsnotificationsmobilealertcardtsx) — *In-app alert drawer and notification preferences component.*
40. [`src/components/notifications/PhoneOnboardingModal.tsx`](#srccomponentsnotificationsphoneonboardingmodaltsx) — *Phone verification modal using cryptographic 6-digit OTP verification.*
41. [`src/components/notifications/SmsMessageDrawer.tsx`](#srccomponentsnotificationssmsmessagedrawertsx) — *Simulated SMS message drawer for zero-cost testing and device demonstration.*
42. [`src/components/notifications/LiveTransitTracker.tsx`](#srccomponentsnotificationslivetransittrackertsx) — *Live transit HUD widget showing real-time ETA, bus stop milestones, and driver contact.*
43. [`src/components/modals/ApiKeyModal.tsx`](#srccomponentsmodalsapikeymodaltsx) — *Configuration dialog for optional external API keys (Google Maps, Firebase).*
44. [`src/components/modals/InstallAppModal.tsx`](#srccomponentsmodalsinstallappmodaltsx) — *PWA and Android APK installation instructions modal.*
45. [`src/services/commuteSafetyEngine.ts`](#srcservicescommutesafetyenginets) — *Commute safety anomaly detection engine monitoring student walking pace and unexpected route deviation.*
46. [`src/services/notificationService.ts`](#srcservicesnotificationservicets) — *Notification client service dispatching safety alerts via backend proxy.*
47. [`scripts/generate-env.js`](#scriptsgenerateenvjs) — *Secure environment configuration generator with cryptographic PIN and JWT secret generation.*
48. [`test_e2e_pilot.mjs`](#teste2epilotmjs) — *Automated 9-stage end-to-end API integration and workflow verification suite.*
49. [`.github/workflows/ci.yml`](#githubworkflowsciyml) — *Automated GitHub Actions CI/CD pipeline verifying lint, security unit tests (28/28), production build, E2E pilot, and load tests on Node 22.*

