## 44. `src/components/modals/InstallAppModal.tsx` <a id="srccomponentsmodalsinstallappmodaltsx"></a>

**Description:** PWA and Android APK installation instructions modal.  
**File Path:** `sreenidhi-express/src/components/modals/InstallAppModal.tsx`  

```tsx
import React, { useState } from 'react';
import {
  X,
  Smartphone,
  Apple,
  Monitor,
  Share2,
  PlusSquare,
