## 49. `.github/workflows/ci.yml` <a id="githubworkflowsciyml"></a>

**Description:** Automated GitHub Actions CI/CD pipeline verifying lint, security unit tests (28/28), production build, E2E pilot, and load tests on Node 22.  
**File Path:** `sreenidhi-express/.github/workflows/ci.yml`  

```yaml
name: Sreenidhi Express CI

on:
  push:
    branches: [ main ]
  pull_request:
    branches: [ main ]

jobs:
  validate-and-test:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest

    steps:
      - name: Checkout Repository
        uses: actions/checkout@v4

      - name: Setup Node.js 22
        uses: actions/setup-node@v4
        with:
          node-version: '22'
          cache: 'npm'

      - name: Install Dependencies
        run: npm ci

      - name: Lint Codebase (oxlint)
        run: npm run lint

      - name: Security & Functional Unit Tests
        run: npm test

      - name: Production Build (Vite & Chunk Verification)
        run: npm run build

      - name: Full 9-Stage E2E Pilot Test
        run: npm run test:pilot

      - name: SSE & HTTP Concurrency Load Benchmark
        run: npm run test:load

```
